<!DOCTYPE html>
<html lang="en">
<head>
<meta charset="UTF-8">
<meta name="viewport" content="width=device-width, initial-scale=1.0">
<title>Tasty Pete — Turkey Legs & Brisket, Made With Love</title>
<link rel="preconnect" href="https://fonts.googleapis.com">
<link rel="preconnect" href="https://fonts.gstatic.com" crossorigin>
<link href="https://fonts.googleapis.com/css2?family=Rye&family=Archivo:ital,wght@0,400;0,500;0,600;0,700;0,800;1,400&display=swap" rel="stylesheet">
<style>
  :root{
    --paper:        #F3E9D2;
    --paper-light:  #FAF5E8;
    --kraft:        #DFC89C;
    --kraft-dark:   #C7A874;
    --ink:          #2B2118;
    --ink-soft:     #574A3B;
    --oxblood:      #8A2E22;
    --oxblood-dark: #6E241B;
    --ember:        #C8862E;
    --twine:        #E9E1CC;
    --max: 1120px;
  }

  *{ box-sizing: border-box; }
  html{ scroll-behavior: smooth; }
  body{
    margin:0;
    background: var(--paper);
    color: var(--ink);
    font-family: 'Archivo', sans-serif;
    -webkit-font-smoothing: antialiased;
    overflow-x: hidden;
  }
  img{ max-width:100%; display:block; }

  h1, h2, h3, .display{
    font-family: 'Rye', serif;
    font-weight: 400;
    line-height: 1.08;
    color: var(--ink);
    letter-spacing: 0.01em;
  }

  a{ color: inherit; text-decoration: none; }
  button{ font-family: inherit; cursor: pointer; }

  .wrap{
    max-width: var(--max);
    margin: 0 auto;
    padding: 0 20px;
  }

  /* subtle paper grain */
  .grain{
    position: fixed;
    inset: 0;
    pointer-events: none;
    opacity: 0.05;
    z-index: 999;
    background-image:
      radial-gradient(circle at 20% 30%, #000 0.5px, transparent 0.5px),
      radial-gradient(circle at 70% 60%, #000 0.5px, transparent 0.5px),
      radial-gradient(circle at 40% 80%, #000 0.5px, transparent 0.5px);
    background-size: 3px 3px, 4px 4px, 5px 5px;
  }

  /* ---------- Twine divider ---------- */
  .twine-divider{
    width: 100%;
    height: 22px;
    display: block;
  }

  /* ---------- Header ---------- */
  header{
    position: sticky;
    top: 0;
    z-index: 100;
    background: var(--paper-light);
    border-bottom: 3px solid var(--ink);
  }
  .nav-row{
    display:flex;
    align-items:center;
    justify-content: space-between;
    padding: 14px 20px;
  }
  .brand{
    display:flex;
    align-items:center;
    gap:10px;
  }
  .brand svg{ width:38px; height:38px; flex-shrink:0; }
  .brand-name{
    font-family:'Rye', serif;
    font-size: 1.35rem;
    color: var(--oxblood);
  }
  nav.links{
    display:none;
    gap: 28px;
    font-weight: 600;
    font-size: 0.95rem;
    color: var(--ink-soft);
  }
  nav.links a:hover{ color: var(--oxblood); }
  .call-btn{
    display:inline-flex;
    align-items:center;
    gap:8px;
    background: var(--oxblood);
    color: var(--paper-light);
    padding: 10px 16px;
    border-radius: 3px;
    font-weight: 700;
    font-size: 0.88rem;
    white-space: nowrap;
    border: 2px solid var(--ink);
    box-shadow: 3px 3px 0 var(--ink);
    transition: transform 0.15s ease, box-shadow 0.15s ease;
  }
  .call-btn:hover{
    transform: translate(1px,1px);
    box-shadow: 2px 2px 0 var(--ink);
  }
  .call-btn svg{ width:16px; height:16px; }
  .burger{
    display:flex;
    background:none;
    border: 2px solid var(--ink);
    border-radius:3px;
    width: 40px; height:40px;
    align-items:center;
    justify-content:center;
  }
  .burger span, .burger span::before, .burger span::after{
    content:'';
    display:block;
    width: 18px; height: 2px;
    background: var(--ink);
    position:relative;
  }
  .burger span::before{ position:absolute; top:-6px; }
  .burger span::after{ position:absolute; top:6px; }

  .mobile-menu{
    display:none;
    flex-direction:column;
    background: var(--paper-light);
    border-bottom: 3px solid var(--ink);
  }
  .mobile-menu.open{ display:flex; }
  .mobile-menu a{
    padding: 14px 20px;
    border-top: 1px solid var(--kraft-dark);
    font-weight:600;
    color: var(--ink-soft);
  }

  /* ---------- Hero ---------- */
  .hero{
    position:relative;
    background: var(--kraft);
    padding: 56px 0 40px;
    text-align:center;
    overflow:hidden;
  }
  .hero::before{
    content:'';
    position:absolute;
    inset:0;
    background:
      repeating-linear-gradient(135deg, rgba(43,33,24,0.035) 0 2px, transparent 2px 14px);
    pointer-events:none;
  }
  .stamp{
    width: 128px;
    height: 128px;
    margin: 0 auto 22px;
    position:relative;
    z-index:1;
  }
  .hero-kicker{
    font-size: 0.95rem;
    font-weight: 700;
    color: var(--oxblood-dark);
    margin-bottom: 6px;
    position:relative;
    z-index:1;
  }
  .hero h1{
    font-size: 2.55rem;
    margin: 0 auto 16px;
    max-width: 11.5ch;
    position:relative;
    z-index:1;
    color: var(--ink);
  }
  .hero h1 .accent{ color: var(--oxblood); }
  .hero p.sub{
    font-size: 1.08rem;
    color: var(--ink-soft);
    max-width: 34ch;
    margin: 0 auto 28px;
    line-height: 1.5;
    position:relative;
    z-index:1;
  }
  .hero-ctas{
    display:flex;
    flex-direction:column;
    gap:12px;
    align-items:center;
    position:relative;
    z-index:1;
  }
  .btn-primary{
    display:inline-flex;
    align-items:center;
    gap:10px;
    background: var(--oxblood);
    color: var(--paper-light);
    padding: 16px 30px;
    font-weight:700;
    font-size: 1.05rem;
    border-radius: 4px;
    border: 2px solid var(--ink);
    box-shadow: 4px 4px 0 var(--ink);
    transition: transform 0.15s ease, box-shadow 0.15s ease;
  }
  .btn-primary:hover{ transform: translate(2px,2px); box-shadow: 2px 2px 0 var(--ink); }
  .btn-primary svg{ width:20px; height:20px; }
  .btn-ghost{
    font-weight:700;
    color: var(--ink);
    border-bottom: 2px solid var(--ink);
    padding-bottom: 2px;
    font-size: 0.95rem;
  }

  /* ---------- Section shell ---------- */
  section{ padding: 54px 0; }
  .section-head{
    text-align:center;
    max-width: 46ch;
    margin: 0 auto 34px;
  }
  .section-head h2{
    font-size: 1.9rem;
    margin: 0 0 12px;
  }
  .section-head p{
    color: var(--ink-soft);
    font-size: 1.02rem;
    line-height: 1.55;
    margin:0;
  }

  /* ---------- About ---------- */
  .about{ background: var(--paper-light); }
  .about-inner{
    display:flex;
    flex-direction:column;
    gap: 28px;
  }
  .about-card{
    background: var(--paper);
    border: 2px solid var(--ink);
    border-radius: 4px;
    padding: 26px 22px;
    position:relative;
  }
  .about-card::after{
    content:'';
    position:absolute;
    top:-10px; left: 50%;
    transform: translateX(-50%) rotate(-2deg);
    width: 62px; height: 20px;
    background: var(--twine);
    border: 1px solid var(--kraft-dark);
  }
  .about-card h3{
    font-size: 1.35rem;
    color: var(--oxblood);
    margin: 0 0 10px;
  }
  .about-card p{
    color: var(--ink-soft);
    line-height: 1.65;
    margin: 0 0 12px;
    font-size: 1.01rem;
  }
  .about-card p:last-child{ margin-bottom:0; }
  .about-stats{
    display:grid;
    grid-template-columns: 1fr 1fr;
    gap: 14px;
  }
  .stat{
    background: var(--paper-light);
    border: 2px solid var(--ink);
    border-radius: 4px;
    padding: 16px 12px;
    text-align:center;
  }
  .stat .num{
    font-family:'Rye', serif;
    font-size: 1.6rem;
    color: var(--oxblood);
    display:block;
  }
  .stat .label{
    font-size: 0.82rem;
    color: var(--ink-soft);
    font-weight: 600;
  }

  /* ---------- Menu ---------- */
  .menu{ background: var(--paper); }
  .menu-grid{
    display:flex;
    flex-direction:column;
    gap: 18px;
  }
  .menu-item{
    background: var(--paper-light);
    border: 2px solid var(--ink);
    border-radius: 4px;
    padding: 22px;
    display:flex;
    gap: 16px;
    align-items:flex-start;
  }
  .menu-item .icon{
    width: 46px; height:46px;
    flex-shrink:0;
    color: var(--oxblood);
  }
  .menu-item h3{
    font-size: 1.25rem;
    margin: 0 0 6px;
    color: var(--ink);
  }
  .menu-item p{
    color: var(--ink-soft);
    font-size: 0.97rem;
    line-height: 1.55;
    margin: 0;
  }
  .menu-item .tag{
    display:inline-block;
    margin-top:10px;
    font-size: 0.78rem;
    font-weight:700;
    color: var(--oxblood-dark);
    background: rgba(138,46,34,0.08);
    padding: 3px 9px;
    border-radius: 20px;
  }
  .menu-note{
    text-align:center;
    margin-top: 26px;
    font-size: 0.95rem;
    color: var(--ink-soft);
  }

  /* ---------- Reviews ---------- */
  .reviews{ background: var(--kraft); position:relative; }
  .reviews::before{
    content:'';
    position:absolute; inset:0;
    background: repeating-linear-gradient(135deg, rgba(43,33,24,0.035) 0 2px, transparent 2px 14px);
    pointer-events:none;
  }
  .review-scroll{
    display:flex;
    gap: 16px;
    overflow-x: auto;
    padding: 4px 4px 14px;
    scroll-snap-type: x mandatory;
    -webkit-overflow-scrolling: touch;
    position:relative;
    z-index:1;
  }
  .review-scroll::-webkit-scrollbar{ height: 6px; }
  .review-scroll::-webkit-scrollbar-thumb{ background: var(--ink); border-radius: 4px; }
  .review-card{
    scroll-snap-align: start;
    flex: 0 0 82%;
    background: var(--paper-light);
    border: 2px solid var(--ink);
    border-radius: 4px;
    padding: 22px;
  }
  .review-card .stars{ color: var(--ember); font-size: 1rem; margin-bottom: 10px; letter-spacing: 2px; }
  .review-card p{
    font-size: 1rem;
    line-height: 1.55;
    color: var(--ink);
    margin: 0 0 14px;
  }
  .review-card .who{
    font-weight: 700;
    font-size: 0.88rem;
    color: var(--ink-soft);
  }

  /* ---------- Order / Contact ---------- */
  .order{ background: var(--ink); color: var(--paper-light); }
  .order .section-head h2{ color: var(--paper-light); }
  .order .section-head p{ color: #C9BDA9; }
  .order-grid{
    display:flex;
    flex-direction:column;
    gap: 26px;
  }
  .order-call{
    background: var(--oxblood);
    border-radius: 6px;
    padding: 30px 24px;
    text-align:center;
  }
  .order-call .phone{
    font-family:'Rye', serif;
    font-size: 2rem;
    display:block;
    margin: 10px 0 18px;
    color: var(--paper-light);
  }
  .order-call p{
    color: #F1D9CD;
    margin: 0 0 4px;
    font-size: 0.95rem;
  }
  .order-call .call-big{
    display:inline-flex;
    align-items:center;
    gap:10px;
    background: var(--paper-light);
    color: var(--oxblood);
    padding: 14px 26px;
    border-radius: 4px;
    font-weight: 800;
    font-size: 1rem;
  }
  .order-call .call-big svg{ width:18px; height:18px; }

  .order-form{
    background: #3A2E22;
    border-radius: 6px;
    padding: 26px 22px;
  }
  .order-form h3{
    font-family:'Rye', serif;
    font-size: 1.3rem;
    margin: 0 0 6px;
    color: var(--paper-light);
  }
  .order-form > p{
    color: #C9BDA9;
    font-size: 0.92rem;
    margin: 0 0 18px;
    line-height: 1.5;
  }
  .field{ margin-bottom: 14px; }
  .field label{
    display:block;
    font-size: 0.82rem;
    font-weight: 700;
    color: #D8CBB6;
    margin-bottom: 6px;
  }
  .field input, .field textarea{
    width:100%;
    background: var(--paper-light);
    border: none;
    border-radius: 4px;
    padding: 12px 14px;
    font-family: inherit;
    font-size: 0.95rem;
    color: var(--ink);
  }
  .field textarea{ resize: vertical; min-height: 80px; }
  .submit-btn{
    width:100%;
    background: var(--ember);
    color: var(--ink);
    border: none;
    border-radius: 4px;
    padding: 14px;
    font-weight: 800;
    font-size: 0.98rem;
  }
  .form-success{
    display:none;
    background: #2E4432;
    color: #DDF0DE;
    padding: 16px;
    border-radius: 4px;
    font-size: 0.92rem;
    line-height: 1.5;
  }
  .form-success.show{ display:block; }

  /* ---------- Footer ---------- */
  footer{
    background: var(--paper-light);
    border-top: 3px solid var(--ink);
    padding: 34px 0 20px;
  }
  .footer-top{
    display:flex;
    flex-direction:column;
    gap: 20px;
    align-items:center;
    text-align:center;
    margin-bottom: 22px;
  }
  .footer-brand{
    display:flex;
    align-items:center;
    gap:10px;
  }
  .footer-brand svg{ width:30px; height:30px; }
  .footer-brand span{
    font-family:'Rye', serif;
    font-size: 1.15rem;
    color: var(--oxblood);
  }
  .footer-tag{
    font-size: 0.9rem;
    color: var(--ink-soft);
    max-width: 30ch;
  }
  .footer-links{
    display:flex;
    gap: 20px;
    flex-wrap:wrap;
    justify-content:center;
    font-size: 0.9rem;
    font-weight:600;
    color: var(--ink-soft);
  }
  .footer-bottom{
    border-top: 1px solid var(--kraft-dark);
    padding-top: 16px;
    text-align:center;
    font-size: 0.78rem;
    color: #8A7C68;
  }
  .footer-bottom a{ color: #8A7C68; text-decoration: underline; }

  /* =========================================================
     Tablet
  ========================================================= */
  @media (min-width: 700px){
    nav.links{ display:flex; }
    .burger{ display:none; }

    .hero{ padding: 76px 0 60px; }
    .hero h1{ font-size: 3.4rem; max-width: 15ch; }
    .hero p.sub{ font-size: 1.18rem; max-width: 42ch; }
    .hero-ctas{ flex-direction: row; }

    .about-inner{
      flex-direction: row;
      align-items: stretch;
    }
    .about-card{ flex: 1.3; }
    .about-stats{ flex: 1; align-content:center; }

    .menu-grid{
      display:grid;
      grid-template-columns: 1fr 1fr;
    }

    .review-card{ flex: 0 0 46%; }

    .order-grid{
      flex-direction: row;
      align-items: stretch;
    }
    .order-call, .order-form{ flex:1; }
    .order-call{ display:flex; flex-direction:column; justify-content:center; }

    .footer-top{
      flex-direction: row;
      justify-content: space-between;
      text-align:left;
    }
    .footer-tag{ text-align:left; }
  }

  /* =========================================================
     Desktop
  ========================================================= */
  @media (min-width: 1020px){
    .hero h1{ font-size: 4rem; }
    .section-head h2{ font-size: 2.3rem; }

    .menu-grid{ grid-template-columns: repeat(2, 1fr); gap: 22px; }
    .menu-item{ padding: 28px; }

    .review-card{ flex: 0 0 32%; }

    .about-card{ padding: 34px 30px; }
  }

  @media (prefers-reduced-motion: reduce){
    *{ scroll-behavior: auto !important; transition: none !important; }
  }
</style>
</head>
<body>

<div class="grain"></div>

<!-- ============ HEADER ============ -->
<header>
  <div class="wrap nav-row">
    <a href="#top" class="brand">
      <svg viewBox="0 0 64 64" fill="none" xmlns="http://www.w3.org/2000/svg">
        <circle cx="32" cy="32" r="30" stroke="#8A2E22" stroke-width="2.5"/>
        <circle cx="32" cy="32" r="24" stroke="#8A2E22" stroke-width="1.5" stroke-dasharray="2 3"/>
        <path d="M20 40c0-5 2-8 4-10-2-3-1-7 2-8 1 2 2 3 3 3h6c1 0 2-1 3-3 3 1 4 5 2 8 2 2 4 5 4 10" stroke="#8A2E22" stroke-width="2.2" stroke-linecap="round" stroke-linejoin="round"/>
        <path d="M26 22c-1-2-1-4 0-5M38 22c1-2 1-4 0-5" stroke="#8A2E22" stroke-width="2.2" stroke-linecap="round"/>
      </svg>
      <span class="brand-name">Tasty Pete</span>
    </a>
    <nav class="links">
      <a href="#about">About</a>
      <a href="#menu">Menu</a>
      <a href="#reviews">Reviews</a>
      <a href="#order">Order</a>
    </nav>
    <a href="tel:5129397013" class="call-btn">
      <svg viewBox="0 0 24 24" fill="none" stroke="currentColor" stroke-width="2"><path d="M22 16.92v3a2 2 0 0 1-2.18 2 19.79 19.79 0 0 1-8.63-3.07 19.5 19.5 0 0 1-6-6 19.79 19.79 0 0 1-3.07-8.67A2 2 0 0 1 4.11 2h3a2 2 0 0 1 2 1.72c.127.96.362 1.903.7 2.81a2 2 0 0 1-.45 2.11L8.09 9.91a16 16 0 0 0 6 6l1.27-1.27a2 2 0 0 1 2.11-.45c.907.338 1.85.573 2.81.7A2 2 0 0 1 22 16.92z"/></svg>
      512-939-7013
    </a>
    <button class="burger" id="burgerBtn" aria-label="Menu"><span></span></button>
  </div>
  <div class="mobile-menu" id="mobileMenu">
    <a href="#about">About</a>
    <a href="#menu">Menu</a>
    <a href="#reviews">Reviews</a>
    <a href="#order">Order</a>
  </div>
</header>

<!-- ============ HERO ============ -->
<div id="top"></div>
<section class="hero">
  <div class="wrap">
    <svg class="stamp" viewBox="0 0 128 128" fill="none" xmlns="http://www.w3.org/2000/svg">
      <circle cx="64" cy="64" r="60" stroke="#8A2E22" stroke-width="3"/>
      <circle cx="64" cy="64" r="49" stroke="#8A2E22" stroke-width="1.5" stroke-dasharray="3 4"/>
      <path d="M40 78c0-9 4-15 7-19-3-6-2-13 3-15 2 4 4 6 6 6h10c2 0 4-2 6-6 5 2 6 9 3 15 3 4 7 10 7 19" stroke="#8A2E22" stroke-width="3.5" stroke-linecap="round" stroke-linejoin="round"/>
      <path d="M52 44c-2-4-2-8 0-10M78 44c2-4 2-8 0-10" stroke="#8A2E22" stroke-width="3.5" stroke-linecap="round"/>
      <text x="64" y="105" text-anchor="middle" font-family="Rye, serif" font-size="9" fill="#8A2E22">EST. AUSTIN, TX</text>
    </svg>
    <p class="hero-kicker">Central Texas smoked BBQ</p>
    <h1>Turkey legs and <span class="accent">brisket</span>, made with love</h1>
    <p class="sub">Low and slow, off a real wood-fired pit. Call ahead, tell Pete what you're feeding, and it'll be ready when you get there.</p>
    <div class="hero-ctas">
      <a href="tel:5129397013" class="btn-primary">
        <svg viewBox="0 0 24 24" fill="none" stroke="currentColor" stroke-width="2"><path d="M22 16.92v3a2 2 0 0 1-2.18 2 19.79 19.79 0 0 1-8.63-3.07 19.5 19.5 0 0 1-6-6 19.79 19.79 0 0 1-3.07-8.67A2 2 0 0 1 4.11 2h3a2 2 0 0 1 2 1.72c.127.96.362 1.903.7 2.81a2 2 0 0 1-.45 2.11L8.09 9.91a16 16 0 0 0 6 6l1.27-1.27a2 2 0 0 1 2.11-.45c.907.338 1.85.573 2.81.7A2 2 0 0 1 22 16.92z"/></svg>
        Call 512-939-7013
      </a>
      <a href="#menu" class="btn-ghost">See what's smoking</a>
    </div>
  </div>
</section>

<!-- twine divider -->
<svg class="twine-divider" viewBox="0 0 400 22" preserveAspectRatio="none" xmlns="http://www.w3.org/2000/svg">
  <path d="M0 11 Q 25 2, 50 11 T 100 11 T 150 11 T 200 11 T 250 11 T 300 11 T 350 11 T 400 11" fill="none" stroke="#C7A874" stroke-width="2"/>
</svg>

<!-- ============ ABOUT ============ -->
<section class="about" id="about">
  <div class="wrap">
    <div class="section-head">
      <h2>A backyard pit that outgrew the backyard</h2>
      <p>No storefront, no drive-thru — just a smoker, good wood, and word of mouth that wouldn't quit.</p>
    </div>
    <div class="about-inner">
      <div class="about-card">
        <h3>How Pete does it</h3>
        <p>Tasty Pete runs on one rule: nothing leaves the smoker until it's ready, not until the clock says so. Turkey legs go in early and come out dark, juicy, and falling off the bone. Brisket gets the long haul — trimmed, rubbed, and rested properly before it's ever sliced.</p>
        <p>There's no dining room and no drive-thru. You call, you order, you pick it up hot. That's the whole operation, and that's exactly why it tastes like someone's actually paying attention.</p>
      </div>
      <div class="about-stats">
        <div class="stat"><span class="num">2</span><span class="label">Signature smokes</span></div>
        <div class="stat"><span class="num">100%</span><span class="label">Made to order</span></div>
        <div class="stat"><span class="num">512</span><span class="label">Austin area code</span></div>
        <div class="stat"><span class="num">1</span><span class="label">Pit, no shortcuts</span></div>
      </div>
    </div>
  </div>
</section>

<!-- ============ MENU ============ -->
<section class="menu" id="menu">
  <div class="wrap">
